DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join our Archives and Special Collections tea
 m on October 28 to document your own Aggie journey! \n\nWe’ll have scrap
 book supplies on hand (while they last) to get you started\, and you’re 
 also welcome to bring your own. Have you been collecting mementos or “ju
 nk” from your Aggie experience —tickets\, photos\, notes\, or receipts
 ? Bring them with you!\n\nOpen to the UC Davis community.\n \n\nQuestions?
  Contact Archives & Special Collections at SpecColl@ucdavis.edu.
LOCATION:Shields Library\, Lobby
